8c90f8b5abf4a80be3b1289d7719d6e03e29684:<path>` blobs with the final commit. Parse Python with `ast.parse(..., type_comments=True)`; remove only the allowlisted leading owner docstrings; normalize only `ast.TypeIgnore.lineno`; require the remaining AST to match. Reject changes to inline or non-allowlisted comments. Preserve runtime strings, assertions, decorators, test data, shebangs, and every directive-bearing physical line exactly. Only adjacent blank-line normalization is allowed.\n\nA reviewer who did not author the leaf must post exactly 4 leaf-linked TSV rows:\n`stable_block_id<TAB>before_citation<TAB>final_citation<TAB>preserved_contract_or_consumer<TAB>directives_exact<TAB>before_words<TAB>after_words<TAB>semantic-preservation<TAB>bloat-removal<TAB>reviewer_session`.\nBefore citations use `88c90f8b5abf4a80be3b1289d7719d6e03e29684:<path>#<stable-id>`; final citations use `<full-final-sha>:<path>#<stable-id>`. Every row must have `after_words < before_words` and all three verdict fields PASS.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The one-commit changed-path set is exactly the 1-path file-impact set.\n- [ ] Only the 4 declared prose blocks and adjacent blank lines change.\n- [ ] The normalized non-docstring AST is identical on every impacted path.\n- [ ] Runtime strings and non-allowlisted comments remain byte-identical.\n- [ ] Directive and shebang physical lines remain byte-identical and attached.\n- [ ] The independent TSV has exactly 4 passing rows.\n- [ ] Every recorded DD command passes, including the no-timeout worktree-venv `make verify`.\n","id":"79cf-60f3-7659-4129","parent_id":"ae4d-df34-480d-4c88","priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in tests/unit — engine-root convention delta"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788630840574454777,"uuid":"4769a452-3f24-43b0-9e17-baafb3b109dc"}